# Search the bounded box for a vehicle pose that brings the locked scene into the arm's reach,
# then move there. The cloud is latched by the caller and is not re-collected during the move.
CloudResult cloud
---
bool success
string message
ParkPose chosen
ParkPose stayed          # what the current pose scores, so the gain from moving is visible

# The same scene, labelled with the frame the arm base stood in when it was latched. Plan
# against this, not against a fresh collect: after the move the camera sees the target from
# too close, and on a replayed bag it cannot see the new viewpoint at all.
CloudResult locked
---
string stage             # searching, moving
uint32 poses_scored
float64 best_score
